# In new syntax, bare identifiers are var refs. $-prefix in head position prevents call.
[$name has? my-var _private get-or]
=== out
[name  has?  my-var  _private  get-or]

=== warn
undefined variable: name at 1:2-1:7
undefined variable: my-var at 1:13-1:19
undefined variable: _private at 1:20-1:28
